{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-111012","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-178500","text":"Every record id on screen is a reference"}]},{"id":"blk-111013","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178501","text":"September 18, 2026. Travis, that evening: "},{"id":"spn-178502","marks":["italic"],"text":"\"there are many areas of plain text where the id of a record is being displayed without the hyperlink or tooltip thing we built earlier … if this could somehow be standardized so this bug doesn't happen again during dev that would be good … thorough checks to make sure this is working in every place text is displayed.\""}]},{"id":"blk-111014","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-178503","text":"What was wrong, measured at "},{"id":"spn-178504","marks":["code"],"text":"2190d36"}]},{"id":"blk-111015","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178505","marks":["code"],"text":"cockpit/ui/references.js"},{"id":"spn-178506","text":" already rendered ids in text as links with a tooltip ("},{"id":"spn-178507","marks":["code"],"text":"a[data-record-ref]"},{"id":"spn-178508","text":", title "},{"id":"spn-178509","marks":["code"],"text":"Kind: id — open current record"},{"id":"spn-178510","text":"), and "},{"id":"spn-178511","marks":["code"],"text":"openRecord"},{"id":"spn-178512","text":" answered the click. It was bypassed in two ways:"}]},{"id":"blk-111016","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111018","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178513","marks":["bold"],"text":"The id pattern was typed by hand beside the kinds table"},{"id":"spn-178514","text":", and knew six prefixes"}]}],"id":"blk-111017","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-111019","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178515","text":"("},{"id":"spn-178516","marks":["code"],"text":"ws gl ln wk rp bt"},{"id":"spn-178517","text":"). Development plans ("},{"id":"spn-178518","marks":["code"],"text":"dt_"},{"id":"spn-178519","text":") and review attempts ("},{"id":"spn-178520","marks":["code"],"text":"da_"},{"id":"spn-178521","text":") were minted by the runtime, projected on every frame and searched by the palette — and never linked, even inside a paragraph."}]},{"id":"blk-111020","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111022","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178522","marks":["bold"],"text":"`node()` in `app-shell.js` linked `<p>` only."},{"id":"spn-178523","text":" Every span, summary, heading,"}]}],"id":"blk-111021","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-111023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178524","text":"list item, "},{"id":"spn-178525","marks":["code"],"text":"small"},{"id":"spn-178526","text":" and button carrying an id printed it plain: the record page header ("},{"id":"spn-178527","marks":["code"],"text":"span.record-id"},{"id":"spn-178528","text":"), the plan rows on record pages ("},{"id":"spn-178529","marks":["code"],"text":"dt_… · rev … · status"},{"id":"spn-178530","text":"), the palette results ("},{"id":"spn-178531","marks":["code"],"text":"kind · id · title"},{"id":"spn-178532","text":"), the attempt card summaries ("},{"id":"spn-178533","marks":["code"],"text":"… · da_…"},{"id":"spn-178534","text":"), the plan meta line, the related-work rows built by "},{"id":"spn-178535","marks":["code"],"text":"detail()"},{"id":"spn-178536","text":". "},{"id":"spn-178537","marks":["code"],"text":"development.js"},{"id":"spn-178538","text":" (the Editor screen) and both phone modules had their own element helpers with the same omission."}]},{"id":"blk-111024","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-178539","text":"The rule"}]},{"id":"blk-111025","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111027","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178540","marks":["bold"],"text":"A record id in any text is a reference, by construction."},{"id":"spn-178541","text":" "},{"id":"spn-178542","marks":["code"],"text":"node()"},{"id":"spn-178543","text":" routes every"}]}],"id":"blk-111026","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178544","text":"tag through "},{"id":"spn-178545","marks":["code"],"text":"referenceText"},{"id":"spn-178546","text":" except raw-data and form tags ("},{"id":"spn-178547","marks":["code"],"text":"pre code textarea input select script style"},{"id":"spn-178548","text":") and "},{"id":"spn-178549","marks":["code"],"text":"option"},{"id":"spn-178550","text":", which keeps its own labelling. "},{"id":"spn-178551","marks":["code"],"text":"development.js"},{"id":"spn-178552","text":"'s "},{"id":"spn-178553","marks":["code"],"text":"el()"},{"id":"spn-178554","text":" and the phone's "},{"id":"spn-178555","marks":["code"],"text":"node()"},{"id":"spn-178556","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-178557","marks":["code"],"text":"el()"},{"id":"spn-178558","text":" follow the same rule."}]},{"id":"blk-111029","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111031","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178559","marks":["bold"],"text":"The pattern is derived from the kinds table."},{"id":"spn-178560","text":" "},{"id":"spn-178561","marks":["code"],"text":"references.js"},{"id":"spn-178562","text":" holds one table —"}]}],"id":"blk-111030","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178563","text":"kind, prefix, projection collection, record route — and builds the regexp from it. Adding a kind is the whole change; a hand-typed list cannot drift from it again."}]},{"id":"blk-111033","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111035","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178564","marks":["bold"],"text":"Two display forms."},{"id":"spn-178565","text":" "},{"id":"spn-178566","marks":["code"],"text":"display:'label'"},{"id":"spn-178567","text":" (default) shows the record's name with the"}]}],"id":"blk-111034","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111036","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178568","text":"id in the tooltip — prose. "},{"id":"spn-178569","marks":["code"],"text":"display:'id'"},{"id":"spn-178570","text":" shows the id with the name in the tooltip — for lines whose job is the identity: record headers, plan rows, palette results, attempt summaries, the plan meta line, related-work subtitles."}]},{"id":"blk-111037","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178571","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside a control there is no link."},{"id":"spn-178572","text":" A reference inside a "},{"id":"spn-178573","marks":["code"],"text":"button"},{"id":"spn-178574","text":", "},{"id":"spn-178575","marks":["code"],"text":"summary"},{"id":"spn-178576","text":","}]}],"id":"blk-111038","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178577","marks":["code"],"text":"label"},{"id":"spn-178578","text":" or another "},{"id":"spn-178579","marks":["code"],"text":"a"},{"id":"spn-178580","text":" renders as "},{"id":"spn-178581","marks":["code"],"text":"span.record-ref"},{"id":"spn-178582","text":" with the same identity and tooltip; the control owns the click. A nested anchor is invalid HTML and steals the click. References built before their control existed are demoted after each frame ("},{"id":"spn-178583","marks":["code"],"text":"demoteNestedReferences"},{"id":"spn-178584","text":", on "},{"id":"spn-178585","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime-view-rendered"},{"id":"spn-178586","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-111041","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111043","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178587","marks":["bold"],"text":"Plans and attempts route to the wizard, not a record page."},{"id":"spn-178588","text":" A plan or attempt"}]}],"id":"blk-111042","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178589","text":"link dispatches "},{"id":"spn-178590","marks":["code"],"text":"open-development-task"},{"id":"spn-178591","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-178592","marks":["code"],"text":"development-tasks.js"},{"id":"spn-178593","text":" answers with one "},{"id":"spn-178594","marks":["code"],"text":"reveal(taskId, attemptId)"},{"id":"spn-178595","text":" shared with "},{"id":"spn-178596","marks":["code"],"text":"[data-development-task]"},{"id":"spn-178597","text":" controls (record pages, the palette). An attempt id opens its card and switches the wizard to every section when the step hides it."}]},{"id":"blk-111045","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111047","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178598","marks":["bold"],"text":"The phone"},{"id":"spn-178599","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-178600","marks":["code"],"text":"mobile/ui"},{"id":"spn-178601","text":") uses the same renderer through the gateway"}]}],"id":"blk-111046","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111048","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178602","text":"("},{"id":"spn-178603","marks":["code"],"text":"/references.js"},{"id":"spn-178604","text":"), in id form; it can open a plan or an attempt's plan, so only those kinds are links there — the rest are tooltip spans ("},{"id":"spn-178605","marks":["code"],"text":"setReferenceRouting"},{"id":"spn-178606","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-111049","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-178607","text":"What holds it"}]},{"id":"blk-111050","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111052","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178608","marks":["bold"],"text":"Static gate"},{"id":"spn-178609","text":" "},{"id":"spn-178610","marks":["code"],"text":"tools/check-reference-text.mjs"},{"id":"spn-178611","text":", in "},{"id":"spn-178612","marks":["code"],"text":"tools/gates.sh"},{"id":"spn-178613","text":": no text sink"}]}],"id":"blk-111051","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111053","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178614","text":"("},{"id":"spn-178615","marks":["code"],"text":"textContent="},{"id":"spn-178616","text":", "},{"id":"spn-178617","marks":["code"],"text":"innerText="},{"id":"spn-178618","