 outside "},{"id":"spn-178637","marks":["code"],"text":"[data-record-ref]"},{"id":"spn-178638","text":" and no link sits inside a control. Then clicks a plan reference (opens the plan in the wizard), a repository reference and a workspace reference (open their record pages), and checks a lane id inside a related-work button is a tooltip span. "},{"id":"spn-178639","marks":["bold"],"text":"55 held · 0 failed."}]},{"id":"blk-111062","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178640","text":"Also run on the rebuilt binary: "},{"id":"spn-178641","marks":["code"],"text":"palette-records-smoke"},{"id":"spn-178642","text":" 12/12, "},{"id":"spn-178643","marks":["code"],"text":"plan-steps-smoke"},{"id":"spn-178644","text":" 9/9, "},{"id":"spn-178645","marks":["code"],"text":"registered-repository-smoke"},{"id":"spn-178646","text":" 19/19, "},{"id":"spn-178647","marks":["code"],"text":"mobile-conversation-smoke"},{"id":"spn-178648","text":" all PASS; "},{"id":"spn-178649","marks":["code"],"text":"node --test tools/*-test.mjs"},{"id":"spn-178650","text":" 284/284; "},{"id":"spn-178651","marks":["code"],"text":"bash tools/gates.sh"},{"id":"spn-178652","text":" 7 held · 2 failed (ordered boundary, ordered closure — pre-existing, "},{"id":"spn-178653","marks":["code"],"text":"ampd/lib"},{"id":"spn-178654","text":" only)."}]},{"id":"blk-111063","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-178655","text":"Not seen on a screen"}]},{"id":"blk-111064","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111066","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178656","marks":["bold"],"text":"A review attempt reference."},{"id":"spn-178657","text":" Recording an attempt needs the Editor's file-proposal"}]}],"id":"blk-111065","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111067","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178658","text":"flow, which the smoke world does not run; the route is unit-tested and shares the plan route. "},{"id":"spn-178659","marks":["code"],"text":"mobile-task-discussion-smoke"},{"id":"spn-178660","text":" could not run here (its native folder chooser did not confirm — environment, not this change)."}]},{"id":"blk-111068","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-111070","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178661","marks":["bold"],"text":"The phone on a phone."},{"id":"spn-178662","text":" The gateway serves the renderer and the conversation smoke"}]}],"id":"blk-111069","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-111071","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178663","text":"loads the page; no Android device is on the tailnet."}]},{"id":"blk-111072","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-178664","text":"Done outside Super, and why"}]},{"id":"blk-111073","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-178665","text":"Written directly. Six UI files change together (the rule is one rule), two of them above the 24 KB share cap ("},{"id":"spn-178666","marks":["code"],"text":"development.js"},{"id":"spn-178667","text":" 54 KB, "},{"id":"spn-178668","marks":["code"],"text":"development-tasks.js"},{"id":"spn-178669","text":" 34 KB), and the review-attempt directory is full ("},{"id":"spn-178670","marks":["code"],"text":"attempt-directory-full"},{"id":"spn-178671","text":" since the afternoon), so no round could be recorded, tested or accepted through Super regardless. Recorded as a plan with this note."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera7qsjlyuhphqmpxberfvdub73smwc5uwgd63banwkj7bqlvmtnf6q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}